  "implementation": [
    "Shared CLI hosts wait on local transport readiness until the existing voluntary idle-frame deadline. Reads do not restart that deadline.",
    "Deferred actual window polls invalidate prepared capture leases and run owner maintenance; unchanged owners do not extract scenes or simulate or create frame receipts.",
    "Maintenance changes publish the current owner boundary and clear the deadline for a fresh poll. Pause, synchronize and stop reset admission.",
    "Default standalone/desktop paths remain separate. Failed-rebuild default timing-accounting behavior is retained. Synchronous graphics/device/audio/storage work can still block."
  ],
